{
  "description": "Golden coverage for syntax enabled by the app renderer beyond CommonMark.",
  "profile": "app",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "emoji shortcode",
      "markdown": ":smile:",
      "expected": "😄"
    },
    {
      "name": "highlight mark",
      "markdown": "==高亮==",
      "expected": "<mark>高亮</mark>"
    },
    {
      "name": "superscript",
      "markdown": "x^2^",
      "expected": "x<sup>2</sup>"
    },
    {
      "name": "numeric subscript",
      "markdown": "H~2~O",
      "expected": "H<sub>2</sub>O"
    },
    {
      "name": "single tildes remain literal",
      "markdown": "~文字~",
      "expected": "~文字~"
    },
    {
      "name": "approximate dates do not form strikethrough",
      "markdown": "> 其余如 Moonshot/Qwen 的\"10 月 15 日\"、OpenAI（~10/19）、Anthropic（~10/28）、Google（~10/28）、xAI（~10/26）、DeepSeek（~11/12）等日期全部是数据聚合器基于历史节奏的统计推测，**没有任何厂商背书**。",
      "mode": "block",
      "expected": "<blockquote>\n<p>其余如 Moonshot/Qwen 的&quot;10 月 15 日&quot;、OpenAI（~10/19）、Anthropic（~10/28）、Google（~10/28）、xAI（~10/26）、DeepSeek（~11/12）等日期全部是数据聚合器基于历史节奏的统计推测，<strong>没有任何厂商背书</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "GFM strikethrough",
      "markdown": "~~文字~~",
      "expected": "<s>文字</s>"
    },
    {
      "name": "inline math",
      "markdown": "$x^2$",
      "contains": [
        "class=\"katex\"",
        "annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "display math",
      "markdown": "$$\nx^2\n$$",
      "mode": "block",
      "contains": [
        "class=\"katex-display\"",
        "annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "linkify",
      "markdown": "https://example.com",
      "expected": "<a href=\"https://example.com\">https://example.com</a>"
    },
    {
      "name": "soft break remains soft",
      "markdown": "a\nb",
      "mode": "block",
      "expected": "<p>a\nb</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "definition list",
      "markdown": "Term\n: Definition",
      "mode": "block",
      "expected": "<dl>\n<dt>Term</dt>\n<dd>Definition</dd>\n</dl>\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "footnote",
      "markdown": "脚注[^1]\n\n[^1]: 内容",
      "mode": "block",
      "contains": [
        "class=\"footnote-ref\"",
        "id=\"fn1\"",
        "footnote-backref"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "punctuation remains literal",
      "markdown": "\"quotes\" -- ...",
      "expected": "&quot;quotes&quot; -- ..."
    }
  ]
}
